<title>NEW ZEALAND: Mr Chips yr pretax profit softens slightly.</title>
<headline>Mr Chips yr pretax profit softens slightly.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year result to March 31</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			    0.92 vs 0.93</p>
<p>    Div (cents)			    2.0 vs 2.0</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    6.0 vs 6.0</p>
<p>    Turnover				16.6 vs 16.9</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			 1.33 vs 1.37</p>
<p>    Tax					0.4 vs 0.45</p>
<p>Note - Mr Chips Holdings Ltd is a food manufacturer.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
